{
  "type": "ai-phone-status-region",
  "version": 1,
  "contract": "【逻辑】\n你在生成一个「Canteen 食堂点评」状态栏。必须严格按照下方字段顺序、数量与格式输出，任何一条不满足都视为无效输出。\n\n1. 必须完整输出 5 个区，顺序固定：基础信息、今日区、热榜区、附近区、我的区；区标题行原样保留（# 今日区 / # 热榜区 / # 附近区 / # 我的区）。\n2. 今日区、热榜区、附近区、我的区必须各包含正好 1 条主贴，ID 固定为 t1、h1、n1、mp1；禁止少写、合并、跳号。\n3. 【评论数量要求】每条主贴（包含我的点评）必须带 3-4 条评论，评论 ID 从 _c1 连续编号；禁止缺评论、跳号。评论需包含普通网友评论以及楼主（帖主）的互动回复。\n4. 字段之间只用半角竖线 | 分隔，字段内禁止出现 |；标签用英文逗号 , 分隔。\n5. 没有内容的字段必须写“无”，禁止留空、写 null、写“暂无”。\n6. 字段数量固定：\n   - 今日区主贴 11 字段：user|time|food|price|fig|rating|score|review|tags|likes|comments\n   - 热榜区主贴 12 字段（多热度）：user|time|food|price|fig|rating|score|review|tags|likes|hotScore|comments\n   - 附近区主贴 12 字段（多距离）：user|distance|time|food|price|fig|rating|score|review|tags|likes|comments\n   - 我的点评 11 字段：同今日区主贴。\n   - 评论固定 4 字段：user|time|text|replyTo（如果只是普通评论，replyTo 填“无”；如果是回复楼上的某人，replyTo 填对方的用户名）。\n   - 收藏固定 4 字段：name|meta|rating|icon（icon填一个emoji）。必须生成 4 条（fav1-fav4）。\n   - 地图固定 4 字段：shop|distance|addr|tags（其中 addr 是详细地点描述，或者是带有角色主观情绪、吐槽的私人地标，如：搓衣板旁边、看着余额流泪的地方）。必须生成 4 条（map1-map4）。不允许和收藏重复。\n   - 好友动态固定 4 字段：name|action|target|time（action如：点评了、收藏了、标记了）。\n7. 字段具体限制：\n   - rating 为 1-5 的整数（代表星星数）。\n   - score 为 1.0-5.0 的一位小数（如 4.8）。\n   - fig 为一句简短的配图描述（不要带“配图：”字样）。\n   - 所有用户名、me_name 必须是网名（如 干饭人小张、隔壁桌小李），禁止使用身份代指（如网友1、我、朋友）。\n8. 所有内容必须严格贴合当前角色人设，语气、评价风格、吃饭偏好由当前剧情决定。\n9. 【格式】区仅为字段结构示例，所有文本必须根据当前剧情与人设全新生成；禁止照抄示例中的任何用户名、食物名、正文、评论、标签、数字。示例里的尖括号只是占位说明，输出时不要保留尖括号。\n10. 只输出 [状态栏] 到 [/状态栏] 之间的内容，禁止解释、禁止代码块、禁止 markdown 表格。\n\n字段列表：\nme_name=我的昵称（如 干饭人小张）\nme_bio=我的简介（12-25字）\nme_posts=点评数量（整数）\nme_followers=关注者数量（整数）\nme_following=关注数量（整数）\nme_recent1=最近动态标签1（如 🍜 今天吃了 牛肉面）\nme_recent2=最近动态标签2（如 ⭐ 收藏了 烧烤摊）\ntoday_date=顶部日期标签（如 周三 · 干饭日）\nfriend1_name=好友动态1-好友网名\nfriend1_action=好友动态1-动作（如 点评了/收藏了）\nfriend1_target=好友动态1-目标名称（如 王姐番茄面）\nfriend1_time=好友动态1-时间（如 12分钟前）\nfriend2_name=好友动态2-好友网名\nfriend2_action=好友动态2-动作\nfriend2_target=好友动态2-目标名称\nfriend2_time=好友动态2-时间\n\n# 今日区\nt1=作者网名|X分钟前|食物名|价格|配图描述|星级(1-5)|分数(如4.8)|评价正文|标签1,标签2|点赞数|评论数\nt1_c1=评论者网名|X分钟前|评论内容|无\nt1_c2=作者网名|X分钟前|回复内容|被回复者网名\nt1_c3=评论者网名|X分钟前|评论内容|无\n\n# 热榜区\nh1=作者网名|X小时前|食物名|价格|配图描述|星级(1-5)|分数(如4.8)|评价正文|标签1,标签2|点赞数|热度(0-100)|评论数\nh1_c1=评论者网名|X小时前|评论内容|无\nh1_c2=作者网名|X小时前|回复内容|被回复者网名\nh1_c3=评论者网名|X小时前|评论内容|无\n\n# 附近区\nn1=作者网名|距离(如0.2km)|刚刚|食物名|价格|配图描述|星级(1-5)|分数(如4.8)|评价正文|标签1,标签2|点赞数|评论数\nn1_c1=评论者网名|刚刚|评论内容|无\nn1_c2=作者网名|刚刚|回复内容|被回复者网名\nn1_c3=评论者网名|刚刚|评论内容|无\n\n# 我的区\nmp1=作者网名(填me_name)|昨天|食物名|价格|配图描述|星级|分数|评价正文|标签|点赞数|评论数\nmp1_c1=评论者网名|昨天|评论内容|无\nmp1_c2=作者网名|昨天|回复内容|被回复者网名\nmp1_c3=评论者网名|昨天|评论内容|无\nfav1=店名|分类描述(如 食堂一楼 · 面食)|评分(如 4.8)|图标emoji\nfav2=同上...\nfav3=同上...\nfav4=同上...\nmap1=店名|距离(如0.1km)|详细地点或吐槽(如 家里浴室搓衣板旁边)|标签1,标签2\nmap2=同上...\nmap3=同上...\nmap4=同上...\n\n【格式】\n全部字段一行一个，整块包裹标记 [状态栏] [/状态栏]\n禁止输出JSON，禁止输出css，禁止输出```代码块。\n以下仅为字段结构，尖括号为占位说明，输出时替换为实际内容，禁止保留尖括号，禁止照抄示例。\n\n[状态栏]\nme_name=<你的网名>\nme_bio=<你的简介>\nme_posts=<数字>\nme_followers=<数字>\nme_following=<数字>\nme_recent1=<带emoji的最近动态>\nme_recent2=<带emoji的最近动态>\ntoday_date=<如 周三 · 干饭日>\nfriend1_name=<好友网名>\nfriend1_action=<动作如 点评了>\nfriend1_target=<目标名如 牛肉面>\nfriend1_time=<X分钟前>\nfriend2_name=<好友网名>\nfriend2_action=<动作如 收藏了>\nfriend2_target=<目标名>\nfriend2_time=<X小时前>\n\n# 今日区\nt1=<作者网名>|<X分钟前>|<食物名>|<价格>|<配图描述>|<1-5整数>|<4.8>|<评价正文>|<标签1,标签2>|<点赞数>|<评论数>\nt1_c1=<评论者网名>|<X分钟前>|<评论内容>|无\nt1_c2=<作者网名>|<X分钟前>|<回复内容>|<被回复者网名>\nt1_c3=<评论者网名>|<X分钟前>|<评论内容>|无\n\n# 热榜区\nh1=<作者网名>|<X小时前>|<食物名>|<价格>|<配图描述>|<1-5整数>|<4.8>|<评价正文>|<标签1,标签2>|<点赞数>|<0-100热度>|<评论数>\nh1_c1=<评论者网名>|<X小时前>|<评论内容>|无\nh1_c2=<作者网名>|<X小时前>|<回复内容>|<被回复者网名>\nh1_c3=<评论者网名>|<X小时前>|<评论内容>|无\n\n# 附近区\nn1=<作者网名>|<X.Xkm>|<刚刚>|<食物名>|<价格>|<配图描述>|<1-5整数>|<4.8>|<评价正文>|<标签1,标签2>|<点赞数>|<评论数>\nn1_c1=<评论者网名>|<刚刚>|<评论内容>|无\nn1_c2=<作者网名>|<刚刚>|<回复内容>|<被回复者网名>\nn1_c3=<评论者网名>|<刚刚>|<评论内容>|无\n\n# 我的区\nmp1=<你的网名>|<昨天>|<食物名>|<价格>|<配图描述>|<1-5整数>|<4.8>|<评价正文>|<标签1,标签2>|<点赞数>|<评论数>\nmp1_c1=<评论者网名>|<昨天>|<评论内容>|无\nmp1_c2=<你的网名>|<昨天>|<回复内容>|<被回复者网名>\nmp1_c3=<评论者网名>|<昨天>|<评论内容>|无\nfav1=<店名>|<分类描述>|<4.8>|<emoji>\nfav2=<店名>|<分类描述>|<4.8>|<emoji>\nfav3=<店名>|<分类描述>|<4.8>|<emoji>\nfav4=<店名>|<分类描述>|<4.8>|<emoji>\nmap1=<店名>|<距离>|<详细地点或带情绪的吐槽>|<标签1,标签2>\nmap2=<店名>|<距离>|<详细地点或带情绪的吐槽>|<标签1,标签2>\nmap3=<店名>|<距离>|<详细地点或带情绪的吐槽>|<标签1,标签2>\nmap4=<店名>|<距离>|<详细地点或带情绪的吐槽>|<标签1,标签2>\n[/状态栏]",
  "renderHtml": "<style>\n* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }\n:root {\n  --bg: #f4f1ec;\n  --card: #ffffff;\n  --ink: #3a332c;\n  --ink-soft: #7a7168;\n  --line: #e8e2d9;\n  --accent: #8B5E3C;\n  --accent-soft: #f0e6dc;\n  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px rgba(58,51,44,0.05);\n  --shadow-lg: 0 6px 24px rgba(58,51,44,0.12);\n}\nbody {\n  position: fixed; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--ink);\n  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', sans-serif;\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  padding: 8px; overflow: hidden;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n}\n#bg-canvas { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; opacity: 0.35; }\n.app {\n  position: relative; z-index: 10;\n  height: 560px; width: 100%; max-width: 360px;\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--line);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n/* 状态栏 */\n.status-bar {\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 11px 14px;\n  background: var(--card);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n.status-bar .title { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }\n.status-bar .title small { font-size: 10px; color: var(--ink-soft); font-weight: 500; margin-left: 4px; }\n.status-bar .date-chip {\n  font-size: 10px; color: var(--ink-soft); background: var(--accent-soft);\n  padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 600;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(139,94,60,0.15);\n}\n/* Me 子页顶部栏 */\n.me-sub-bar {\n  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\n  padding: 11px 14px;\n  background: var(--card);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  animation: slideDown .3s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);\n}\n@keyframes slideDown { from { transform: translateY(-100%); opacity: 0; } to { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; } }\n.me-sub-bar .back-btn {\n  width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%;\n  background: var(--accent-soft); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  cursor: pointer; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; transition: transform .2s, background .2s;\n  flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--accent);\n}\n.me-sub-bar .back-btn:active { transform: scale(0.9); background: var(--line); }\n.me-sub-bar .sub-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink); }\n.me-sub-bar .sub-count { font-size: 10px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-left: auto; background: var(--accent-soft); padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; }\n\n/* Tab */\n.tabs { display: flex; background: var(--card); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); flex-shrink: 0; padding: 0 4px; }\n.tabs .tab {\n  flex: 1; text-align: center; padding: 10px 0; font-size: 12px;\n  color: var(--ink-soft); cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600;\n  position: relative; transition: color .3s;\n}\n.tabs .tab .ic { font-size: 13px; margin-right: 2px; opacity: 0.7; }\n.tabs .tab.active { color: var(--accent); }\n.tabs .tab.active .ic { opacity: 1; }\n.tabs .tab.active::after {\n  content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: -1px; left: 50%;\n  transform: translateX(-50%); width: 20px; height: 2px;\n  background: var(--accent); border-radius: 2px;\n  animation: tabIn .35s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);\n}\n@keyframes tabIn { from { width: 0; opacity: 0; } to { width: 20px; opacity: 1; } }\n\n/* 内部滚动区 */\n.feed { flex: 1; min-height: 0; overflow-y: auto; padding-bottom: 4px; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }\n.feed::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }\n\n/* 帖子卡片 */\n.post {\n  background: var(--card); margin: 8px 10px;\n  border-radius: 12px; padding: 11px;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n  border: 1px solid var(--line);\n  animation: cardIn .5s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both;\n}\n@keyframes cardIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }\n.post-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n.avatar {\n  width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%;\n  background: #e2ddd7; flex-shrink: 0;\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.avatar svg { width: 110%; height: 110%; transform: translateY(2px); }\n.avatar svg .head { fill: #9a9289; }\n.avatar svg .shoulders { fill: #9a9289; }\n.rank-badge { width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; flex-shrink: 0; color: #fff; }\n.rank-1 { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#d4a24c,#b8862b); }\n.rank-2 { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#a8a8a8,#888); }\n.rank-n { background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent); }\n.post-meta { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }\n.post-meta .name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }\n.post-meta .sub { font-size: 10px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top: 1px; }\n.dist-tag { font-size: 9px; color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent-soft); padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 600; border: 1px solid rgba(139,94,60,0.12); }\n\n.food-line { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n.food-name { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: 0.3px; }\n.food-price { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent-soft); padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid rgba(139,94,60,0.15); }\n.figcap { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; background: var(--card); border: 1px dashed var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 4px 8px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom: 8px; transition: border-color .3s, color .3s; }\n.figcap .pin { font-size: 11px; }\n.figcap:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }\n.rating-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.stars { color: #d4a24c; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1px; }\n.score-chip { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; background: var(--accent); padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 6px; }\n.review-text { font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4a4239; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.post-tags { display: flex; gap: 4px; margin-bottom: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n.post-tags .tag { font-size: 10px; color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent-soft); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; border: 1px solid rgba(139,94,60,0.1); }\n.hot-bar { height: 3px; background: var(--line); border-radius: 2px; margin-bottom: 8px; overflow: hidden; }\n.hot-fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg,#a8866b,#8B5E3C); }\n\n.post-actions { display: flex; gap: 20px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px dashed var(--line); }\n.action { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-soft); cursor: pointer; user-select: none; transition: color .2s; }\n.action .icon { font-size: 14px; transition: transform .25s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1); }\n.action:active .icon { transform: scale(1.4); }\n.action.liked { color: #c8553d; }\n.action.liked .icon { animation: heartPop .4s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1); }\n@keyframes heartPop { 0% { transform: scale(1); } 40% { transform: scale(1.5); } 100% { transform: scale(1); } }\n\n/* 评论区 */\n.comments { margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px dashed var(--line); display: none; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }\n.comments.open { display: block; }\n.comments .label { font-size: 10px; color: var(--ink-soft); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }\n.comment-thread { margin-bottom: 4px; }\n.comment { display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 7px; opacity: 0; animation: danmu .6s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) forwards; }\n@keyframes danmu { 0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px) scale(.96); } 55% { opacity: 0.85; } 100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); } }\n.comment-avatar { width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; background: #e2ddd7; overflow: hidden; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }\n.comment-avatar svg { width: 110%; height: 110%; }\n.comment-avatar svg .head { fill: #9a9289; }\n.comment-avatar svg .shoulders { fill: #9a9289; }\n.comment-body { flex: 1; }\n.comment-name { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); }\n.comment-name.is-author { color: #c8553d; }\n.comment-name.is-author::after { content: ' 帖主'; font-size: 8px; background: #c8553d; color: #fff; padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 3px; margin-left: 3px; font-weight: 600; }\n.comment-text { font-size: 11.5px; color: #4a4239; line-height: 1.4; margin-top: 1px; }\n.comment-text .reply-to { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }\n.comment-time { font-size: 9px; color: #b5aca2; margin-top: 1px; }\n.reply-chain { margin-left: 30px; border-left: 2px solid var(--line); padding-left: 8px; }\n\n/* Me 页 */\n.me-cover { background: linear-gradient(160deg, #4a4038, #6b5d50); padding: 18px 14px 16px; text-align: center; position: relative; overflow: hidden; flex-shrink: 0; }\n.me-cover::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(255,255,255,0.08), transparent 40%); }\n.me-cover .deco-l, .me-cover .deco-r { position: absolute; top: 10px; font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.5; }\n.me-cover .deco-l { left: 10px; }\n.me-cover .deco-r { right: 10px; }\n.me-avatar-wrap { width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 auto 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35); position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n.me-avatar-wrap svg { width: 62%; height: 62%; }\n.me-avatar-wrap svg .head { fill: #e8e2d9; }\n.me-avatar-wrap svg .shoulders { fill: #e8e2d9; }\n.me-name { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n.me-bio { font-size: 10px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72); margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.4; position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n.me-stats { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 0; background: var(--card); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); flex-shrink: 0; }\n.me-stat { flex: 1; text-align: center; padding: 10px 0; cursor: pointer; position: relative; transition: background .2s; }\n.me-stat:active { background: var(--accent-soft); }\n.me-stat::after { content: ''; position: absolute; right: 0; top: 25%; height: 50%; width: 1px; background: var(--line); }\n.me-stat:last-child::after { display: none; }\n.me-stat-num { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink); }\n.me-stat-label { font-size: 9px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top: 2px; }\n.me-recent { display: flex; gap: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; background: var(--card); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); overflow-x: auto; flex-shrink: 0; }\n.me-recent::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }\n.me-recent-tag { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 16px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; flex-shrink: 0; background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent); }\n.me-entries { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; padding: 10px 10px 8px; background: var(--bg); flex-shrink: 0; }\n.me-entry-btn { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 14px 6px 10px; border-radius: 12px; cursor: pointer; transition: transform .15s, box-shadow .2s; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--card); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }\n.me-entry-btn:active { transform: scale(0.96); box-shadow: none; }\n.me-entry-btn .entry-ic { font-size: 22px; }\n.me-entry-btn .entry-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink); }\n.me-entry-btn .entry-sub { font-size: 9px; color: var(--ink-soft); }\n.me-entry-btn .entry-badge { position: absolute; top: 6px; right: 6px; font-size: 8px; background: var(--accent); color: #fff; padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 700; }\n.me-friends { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding-bottom: 8px; }\n.me-friends::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }\n.me-friends-title { padding: 10px 10px 4px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-soft); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }\n.friend-activity { display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; animation: cardIn .4s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both; }\n.friend-activity .fa-avatar { width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; background: #e2ddd7; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; }\n.friend-activity .fa-avatar svg { width: 110%; height: 110%; }\n.friend-activity .fa-avatar svg .head { fill: #9a9289; }\n.friend-activity .fa-avatar svg .shoulders { fill: #9a9289; }\n.fa-content { flex: 1; }\n.fa-name { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }\n.fa-action { font-size: 10px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top: 1px; }\n.fa-target { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }\n.fa-time { font-size: 8px; color: #b5aca2; margin-top: 1px; }\n.me-sub-content { animation: subIn .35s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1); }\n@keyframes subIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(16px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); } }\n.fav-item { background: var(--card); margin: 8px 10px; border-radius: 12px; padding: 10px 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); border: 1px solid var(--line); animation: cardIn .4s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both; }\n.fav-item .fav-thumb { width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 8px; flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 22px; background: var(--accent-soft); }\n.fav-item .fav-info { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }\n.fav-item .fav-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 2px; }\n.fav-item .fav-meta { font-size: 10px; color: var(--ink-soft); }\n.fav-item .fav-rating { font-size: 11px; color: #d4a24c; font-weight: 700; }\n.map-item { background: var(--card); margin: 8px 10px; border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); border: 1px solid var(--line); animation: cardIn .4s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both; }\n.map-item .map-row1 { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n.map-item .map-shop { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink); }\n.map-item .map-dist { font-size: 10px; color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent-soft); padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 4px; }\n.map-item .map-addr { font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom: 6px; }\n.map-item .map-tags { display: flex; gap: 4px; }\n.map-item .map-tags .tag { font-size: 9px; color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent-soft); padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 6px; }\n\n/* 底部导航 */\n.bottom-nav { display: flex; background: var(--card); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); flex-shrink: 0; }\n.bottom-nav .nav-item { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 2px; padding: 8px 0 10px; cursor: pointer; color: #b5aca2; position: relative; transition: color .3s; }\n.bottom-nav .nav-item .nav-icon { font-size: 18px; transition: transform .25s; }\n.bottom-nav .nav-item:active .nav-icon { transform: scale(1.15); }\n.bottom-nav .nav-item.active { color: var(--accent); }\n.bottom-nav .nav-item.active .nav-icon { animation: bounceIn .4s; }\n.bottom-nav .nav-item.active::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -1px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); width: 24px; height: 2px; background: var(--accent); border-radius: 0 0 2px 2px; }\n@keyframes bounceIn { 0% { transform: scale(0.6); } 60% { transform: scale(1.15); } 100% { transform: scale(1); } }\n.nav-label { font-size: 9px; font-weight: 600; }\n.empty-state { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 40px 16px; color: #b5aca2; text-align: center; }\n.empty-state .empty-icon { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 8px; opacity: 0.6; }\n</style>\n<canvas id=\"bg-canvas\"></canvas>\n<div class=\"app\">\n  <div class=\"status-bar\" id=\"main-status\">\n    <div class=\"title\">🍜 Canteen <small>· 今天吃什么</small></div>\n    <div class=\"date-chip\" id=\"today-badge\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"me-sub-bar\" id=\"me-sub-bar\" style=\"display:none;\">\n    <div class=\"back-btn\" onclick=\"closeMeSub()\">‹</div>\n    <div class=\"sub-title\" id=\"me-sub-title\">我的点评</div>\n    <div class=\"sub-count\" id=\"me-sub-count\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"tabs\" id=\"tabs-slot\">\n    <div class=\"tab active\" data-tab=\"today\" onclick=\"switchTab(this)\"><span class=\"ic\">🍚</span>今日</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\" data-tab=\"hot\" onclick=\"switchTab(this)\"><span class=\"ic\">🔥</span>热榜</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\" data-tab=\"nearby\" onclick=\"switchTab(this)\"><span class=\"ic\">📍</span>附近</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"feed\" id=\"feed\"></div>\n  <div class=\"bottom-nav\">\n    <div class=\"nav-item active\" data-page=\"home\" onclick=\"switchPage(this)\"><span class=\"nav-icon\">🏠</span><span class=\"nav-label\">首页</span></div>\n    <div class=\"nav-item\" data-page=\"me\" onclick=\"switchPage(this)\"><span class=\"nav-icon\">👤</span><span class=\"nav-label\">我的</span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script>\nconst bg = document.getElementById('bg-canvas');\nconst ctx = bg.getContext('2d');\nfunction resizeBg() { bg.width = window.innerWidth; bg.height = window.innerHeight; }\nresizeBg(); window.addEventListener('resize', resizeBg);\nconst emojis = ['🍜','🍚','🍣','🥟','🍲','🥗','🍤','🧋','🍞','🥑','🍰','🦐'];\nconst particles = [];\nfor (let i = 0; i < 14; i++) {\n  particles.push({ x: Math.random() * window.innerWidth, y: Math.random() * window.innerHeight, r: Math.random() * 8 + 8, emoji: emojis[Math.floor(Math.random() * emojis.length)], speedY: Math.random() * 0.2 + 0.05, speedX: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.15, opacity: Math.random() * 0.18 + 0.06, rot: Math.random() * 360, rotSpeed: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 1 });\n}\nfunction animateBg() {\n  ctx.clearRect(0, 0, bg.width, bg.height);\n  particles.forEach(p => {\n    p.y -= p.speedY; p.x += p.speedX; p.rot += p.rotSpeed;\n    if (p.y < -20) { p.y = bg.height + 20; p.x = Math.random() * bg.width; }\n    if (p.x > bg.width + 20) p.x = -20; if (p.x < -20) p.x = bg.width + 20;\n    ctx.save(); ctx.globalAlpha = p.opacity; ctx.translate(p.x, p.y); ctx.rotate(p.rot * Math.PI / 180);\n    ctx.font = p.r + 'px serif'; ctx.textAlign = 'center'; ctx.textBaseline = 'middle';\n    ctx.fillText(p.emoji, 0, 0); ctx.restore();\n  });\n  requestAnimationFrame(animateBg);\n}\nanimateBg();\n\nfunction avatarSVG() { return `<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle class=\"head\" cx=\"12\" cy=\"8.2\" r=\"4.2\"/><path class=\"shoulders\" d=\"M2.5 21c0-4.8 4.2-7.5 9.5-7.5s9.5 2.7 9.5 7.5v1.5H2.5z\"/></svg>`; }\n\nconst raw = (window.STATUS_RAW || '').replace(/^\\[状态栏\\]/,'').replace(/\\[\\/状态栏\\]$/,'').trim();\nconst data = {};\nconst state = {\n  currentPage: 'home', currentTab: 'today', meSubPage: null,\n  me: { name: '干饭人', bio: '', posts: 0, followers: 0, following: 0, recent: [], myPosts: [], favs: [], mapItems: [], friends: [] },\n  posts: { today: [], hot: [], nearby: [] }\n};\nconst rawComments = {};\n\nraw.split('\\n').forEach(line => {\n  line = line.trim(); if (!line) return;\n  const eq = line.indexOf('='); if (eq <= 0) return;\n  const k = line.substring(0, eq).trim();\n  let v = line.substring(eq + 1).trim();\n  v = v.replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ''); \n  data[k] = v;\n  \n  if (k.match(/_c\\d+$/)) {\n    const pid = k.split('_')[0];\n    if (!rawComments[pid]) rawComments[pid] = [];\n    rawComments[pid].push(v.split('|').map(s => s.trim()));\n  }\n});\n\nfunction parsePost(str, isHot, isNear) {\n  const p = str.split('|').map(s => s.trim());\n  const newId = Math.floor(Math.random() * 1000000) + 1; \n  if (isNear) {\n    return { id: newId, name: p[0], distance: p[1], time: p[2], food: p[3], price: p[4], fig: p[5], rating: parseInt(p[6])||5, score: p[7], review: p[8], tags: p[9].split(','), likes: parseInt(p[10])||0, comments: [], displayComments: p[11] };\n  } else if (isHot) {\n    return { id: newId, name: p[0], time: p[1], food: p[2], price: p[3], fig: p[4], rating: parseInt(p[5])||5, score: p[6], review: p[7], tags: p[8].split(','), likes: parseInt(p[9])||0, hot: parseInt(p[10])||0, comments: [], displayComments: p[11] };\n  } else {\n    return { id: newId, name: p[0], time: p[1], food: p[2], price: p[3], fig: p[4], rating: parseInt(p[5])||5, score: p[6], review: p[7], tags: p[8].split(','), likes: parseInt(p[9])||0, comments: [], displayComments: p[10] };\n  }\n}\n\nstate.me.name = data.me_name || '';\nstate.me.bio = data.me_bio || '';\nstate.me.posts = data.me_posts || 0;\nstate.me.followers = data.me_followers || 0;\nstate.me.following = data.me_following || 0;\nif(data.me_recent1) state.me.recent.push(data.me_recent1);\nif(data.me_recent2) state.me.recent.push(data.me_recent2);\ndocument.getElementById('today-badge').textContent = data.today_date || '干饭日';\n\nif(data.t1) state.posts.today.push(parsePost(data.t1, false, false));\nif(data.h1) state.posts.hot.push(parsePost(data.h1, true, false));\nif(data.n1) state.posts.nearby.push(parsePost(data.n1, false, true));\n\n// 只保留 mp1\n['mp1'].forEach(k => { if(data[k]) state.me.myPosts.push(parsePost(data[k], false, false)); });\n\n// 增加 fav4\n['fav1','fav2','fav3','fav4'].forEach(k => {\n  if(data[k]) { const p = data[k].split('|'); state.me.favs.push({ name: p[0], meta: p[1], rating: p[2], thumb: p[3] }); }\n});\n\n// 增加 map4\n['map1','map2','map3','map4'].forEach(k => {\n  if(data[k]) { const p = data[k].split('|'); state.me.mapItems.push({ shop: p[0], dist: p[1], addr: p[2], tags: p[3].split(',') }); }\n});\n\nif (data.friend1_name) {\n  state.me.friends.push({ name: data.friend1_name, action: data.friend1_action, target: data.friend1_target, time: data.friend1_time });\n}\nif (data.friend2_name) {\n  state.me.friends.push({ name: data.friend2_name, action: data.friend2_action, target: data.friend2_target, time: data.friend2_time });\n}\n\nObject.keys(rawComments).forEach(pid => {\n  let arr = [];\n  if (pid === 't1') arr = state.posts.today;\n  else if (pid === 'h1') arr = state.posts.hot;\n  else if (pid === 'n1') arr = state.posts.nearby;\n  else if (pid === 'mp1') arr = state.me.myPosts;\n  \n  const idx = parseInt(pid.replace(/[^\\d]/g, '')) - 1;\n  if (arr && arr[idx]) {\n    rawComments[pid].forEach(c => {\n      arr[idx].comments.push({\n        user: c[0], time: c[1], text: c[2], replyTo: (c[3] === '无' || !c[3]) ? null : c[3],\n        isAuthor: c[0] === arr[idx].name\n      });\n    });\n  }\n});\n\nfunction renderStars(r) { let s = ''; for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) s += i < r ? '★' : '☆'; return s; }\n\nfunction renderComments(post) {\n  const parents = post.comments.filter(c => !c.replyTo);\n  const replies = post.comments.filter(c => c.replyTo);\n  let html = `<div class=\"comments\" id=\"comments-${post.id}\"><div class=\"label\">💬 大家都在说</div>`;\n  parents.forEach(pc => {\n    const authorClass = pc.isAuthor ? 'is-author' : '';\n    const rcList = replies.filter(rc => rc.replyTo === pc.user);\n    html += `<div class=\"comment-thread\" style=\"animation: danmu .6s both\">\n      <div class=\"comment\">\n        <div class=\"comment-avatar\">${avatarSVG()}</div>\n        <div class=\"comment-body\">\n          <div class=\"comment-name ${authorClass}\">${pc.user}</div>\n          <div class=\"comment-text\">${pc.text}</div>\n          <div class=\"comment-time\">${pc.time}</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>`;\n    if (rcList.length) {\n      html += `<div class=\"reply-chain\">`;\n      rcList.forEach(rc => {\n        const rAuthorClass = rc.isAuthor ? 'is-author' : '';\n        html += `<div class=\"comment\" style=\"animation: danmu .6s both\">\n          <div class=\"comment-avatar\">${avatarSVG()}</div>\n          <div class=\"comment-body\">\n            <div class=\"comment-name ${rAuthorClass}\">${rc.user}</div>\n            <div class=\"comment-text\"><span class=\"reply-to\">@${rc.replyTo}</span> ${rc.text}</div>\n            <div class=\"comment-time\">${rc.time}</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>`;\n      });\n      html += `</div>`;\n    }\n    html += `</div>`;\n  });\n  html += `</div>`;\n  return html;\n}\n\nfunction renderMeHome() {\n  let recentHtml = state.me.recent.map(r => `<div class=\"me-recent-tag\">${r}</div>`).join('');\n  \n  let friendsHtml = '';\n  if (state.me.friends.length > 0) {\n    friendsHtml = state.me.friends.map(f => `\n      <div class=\"friend-activity\">\n        <div class=\"fa-avatar\">${avatarSVG()}</div>\n        <div class=\"fa-content\">\n          <div class=\"fa-name\">${f.name}</div>\n          <div class=\"fa-action\">${f.action} <span class=\"fa-target\">${f.target}</span></div>\n          <div class=\"fa-time\">${f.time}</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    `).join('');\n  } else {\n    friendsHtml = `<div class=\"friend-activity\"><div class=\"fa-avatar\">${avatarSVG()}</div><div class=\"fa-content\"><div class=\"fa-name\">暂无动态</div></div></div>`;\n  }\n\n  return `\n    <div class=\"me-cover\">\n      <span class=\"deco-l\">✦</span><span class=\"deco-r\">✦</span>\n      <div class=\"me-avatar-wrap\">${avatarSVG()}</div>\n      <div class=\"me-name\">${state.me.name}</div>\n      <div class=\"me-bio\">${state.me.bio}</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"me-stats\">\n      <div class=\"me-stat\"><div class=\"me-stat-num\">${state.me.posts}</div><div class=\"me-stat-label\">点评</div></div>\n      <div class=\"me-stat\"><div class=\"me-stat-num\">${state.me.followers}</div><div class=\"me-stat-label\">关注者</div></div>\n      <div class=\"me-stat\"><div class=\"me-stat-num\">${state.me.following}</div><div class=\"me-stat-label\">关注</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"me-recent\">${recentHtml}</div>\n    <div class=\"me-entries\">\n      <div class=\"me-entry-btn\" onclick=\"openMeSub('posts')\"><span class=\"entry-badge\">${state.me.myPosts.length}</span><span class=\"entry-ic\">📝</span><span class=\"entry-label\">我的点评</span><span class=\"entry-sub\">${state.me.myPosts.length} 条</span></div>\n      <div class=\"me-entry-btn\" onclick=\"openMeSub('favs')\"><span class=\"entry-badge\">${state.me.favs.length}</span><span class=\"entry-ic\">⭐</span><span class=\"entry-label\">我的收藏</span><span class=\"entry-sub\">${state.me.favs.length} 家</span></div>\n      <div class=\"me-entry-btn\" onclick=\"openMeSub('map')\"><span class=\"entry-badge\">${state.me.mapItems.length}</span><span class=\"entry-ic\">🗺️</span><span class=\"entry-label\">美食地图</span><span class=\"entry-sub\">${state.me.mapItems.length} 处</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"me-friends-title\">👥 好友动态</div>\n    <div class=\"me-friends\">\n      ${friendsHtml}\n    </div>`;\n}\n\nfunction renderMeSub() {\n  let html = `<div class=\"me-sub-content\">`;\n  if (state.meSubPage === 'posts') {\n    state.me.myPosts.forEach(post => {\n      html += `<div class=\"post\"><div class=\"post-header\"><div class=\"avatar\">${avatarSVG()}</div><div class=\"post-meta\"><div class=\"name\">${post.name}</div><div class=\"sub\">${post.time}</div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"food-line\"><span class=\"food-name\">${post.food}</span><span class=\"food-price\">${post.price}</span></div>\n        <div class=\"figcap\"><span class=\"pin\">🖼️</span>配图：${post.fig}</div>\n        <div class=\"rating-row\"><span class=\"stars\">${renderStars(post.rating)}</span><span class=\"score-chip\">${post.score} 分</span></div>\n        <div class=\"review-text\">${post.review}</div>\n        <div class=\"post-tags\">${post.tags.map(t => `<span class=\"tag\">${t}</span>`).join('')}</div>\n        <div class=\"post-actions\"><div class=\"action\" onclick=\"toggleLike(${post.id}, this)\"><span class=\"icon\">🤍</span><span>${post.likes}</span></div><div class=\"action\" onclick=\"toggleComments(${post.id})\"><span class=\"icon\">💬</span><span>${post.displayComments}</span></div></div>\n        ${renderComments(post)}</div>`;\n    });\n  } else if (state.meSubPage === 'favs') {\n    state.me.favs.forEach((f, i) => {\n      html += `<div class=\"fav-item\" style=\"animation-delay:${i * 0.06}s\"><div class=\"fav-thumb\">${f.thumb}</div><div class=\"fav-info\"><div class=\"fav-name\">${f.name}</div><div class=\"fav-meta\">${f.meta}</div></div><div class=\"fav-rating\">★ ${f.rating}</div></div>`;\n    });\n  } else if (state.meSubPage === 'map') {\n    state.me.mapItems.forEach((m, i) => {\n      html += `<div class=\"map-item\" style=\"animation-delay:${i * 0.06}s\"><div class=\"map-row1\"><div class=\"map-shop\">${m.shop}</div><div class=\"map-dist\">📍 ${m.dist}</div></div><div class=\"map-addr\">${m.addr}</div><div class=\"map-tags\">${m.tags.map(t => `<span class=\"tag\">${t}</span>`).join('')}</div></div>`;\n    });\n  }\n  html += `</div>`;\n  return html;\n}\n\nfunction renderPosts() {\n  const feed = document.getElementById('feed');\n  let html = '';\n  if (state.currentPage === 'me') {\n    if (state.meSubPage) html = renderMeSub();\n    else html = renderMeHome();\n  } else {\n    const list = state.posts[state.currentTab] || [];\n    list.forEach(post => {\n      let headerExtra = '';\n      if (state.currentTab === 'hot') {\n        headerExtra = `<div class=\"rank-badge rank-1\">1</div>`;\n      } else if (state.currentTab === 'nearby') {\n        headerExtra = `<span class=\"dist-tag\">📍 ${post.distance}</span>`;\n      }\n      const hotBar = state.currentTab === 'hot' ? `<div class=\"hot-bar\"><div class=\"hot-fill\" style=\"width:${post.hot}%\"></div></div>` : '';\n      html += `<div class=\"post\">\n        <div class=\"post-header\">${headerExtra}<div class=\"avatar\">${avatarSVG()}</div><div class=\"post-meta\"><div class=\"name\">${post.name}</div><div class=\"sub\">${post.time}</div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"food-line\"><span class=\"food-name\">${post.food}</span><span class=\"food-price\">${post.price}</span></div>\n        <div class=\"figcap\"><span class=\"pin\">🖼️</span>配图：${post.fig}</div>\n        <div class=\"rating-row\"><span class=\"stars\">${renderStars(post.rating)}</span><span class=\"score-chip\">${post.score} 分</span></div>\n        <div class=\"review-text\">${post.review}</div>\n        <div class=\"post-tags\">${post.tags.map(t => `<span class=\"tag\">${t}</span>`).join('')}</div>\n        ${hotBar}\n        <div class=\"post-actions\">\n          <div class=\"action\" onclick=\"toggleLike(${post.id}, this)\"><span class=\"icon\">🤍</span><span>${post.likes}</span></div>\n          <div class=\"action\" onclick=\"toggleComments(${post.id})\"><span class=\"icon\">💬</span><span>${post.displayComments}</span></div>\n          <div class=\"action\" onclick=\"this.querySelector('.icon').textContent='✅'\"><span class=\"icon\">📎</span><span>分享</span></div>\n        </div>\n        ${renderComments(post)}\n      </div>`;\n    });\n  }\n  feed.innerHTML = html || `<div class=\"empty-state\"><div class=\"empty-icon\">🍽️</div><div>今天还没人发点评</div></div>`;\n}\n\nfunction openMeSub(page) {\n  state.meSubPage = page;\n  document.getElementById('main-status').style.display = 'none';\n  document.getElementById('me-sub-bar').style.display = 'flex';\n  const titles = { posts: '我的点评', favs: '我的收藏', map: '美食地图' };\n  document.getElementById('me-sub-title').textContent = titles[page];\n  renderPosts();\n}\nfunction closeMeSub() {\n  state.meSubPage = null;\n  document.getElementById('me-sub-bar').style.display = 'none';\n  document.getElementById('main-status').style.display = 'flex';\n  renderPosts();\n}\nfunction toggleComments(postId) {\n  const el = document.getElementById('comments-' + postId);\n  if (!el) return;\n  if (el.classList.contains('open')) {\n    el.classList.remove('open');\n  } else {\n    el.classList.remove('open'); \n    void el.offsetWidth; \n    el.classList.add('open');\n  }\n}\nfunction toggleLike(postId, el) {\n  let post = state.me.myPosts.find(p => p.id === postId);\n  if (!post) Object.keys(state.posts).forEach(k => { const f = state.posts[k].find(p => p.id === postId); if (f) post = f; });\n  if (!post) return;\n  if (post.liked) { post.likes--; post.liked = false; el.classList.remove('liked'); el.querySelector('.icon').textContent = '🤍'; }\n  else { post.likes++; post.liked = true; el.classList.add('liked'); el.querySelector('.icon').textContent = '❤️'; }\n  el.querySelector('span:last-child').textContent = post.likes;\n}\nfunction switchTab(el) {\n  document.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));\n  el.classList.add('active');\n  state.currentTab = el.dataset.tab;\n  renderPosts();\n}\nfunction switchPage(el) {\n  document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item').forEach(n => n.classList.remove('active'));\n  el.classList.add('active');\n  state.currentPage = el.dataset.page;\n  const tabsSlot = document.getElementById('tabs-slot');\n  if (state.currentPage === 'me') {\n    tabsSlot.style.display = 'none';\n    state.meSubPage = null;\n    document.getElementById('me-sub-bar').style.display = 'none';\n    document.getElementById('main-status').style.display = 'flex';\n  } else {\n    tabsSlot.style.display = 'flex';\n    const firstTab = tabsSlot.querySelector('.tab');\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));\n    firstTab.classList.add('active');\n    state.currentTab = 'today';\n  }\n  renderPosts();\n}\nrenderPosts();\n</script>",
  "previewRaw": "[状态栏]\nme_name=贫民窟二少\nme_bio=能省则省，绝不乱花一分钱。记录各种离奇的省钱日常。\nme_posts=47\nme_followers=1283\nme_following=256\nme_recent1=🧼 今天手洗了全家人的床单\nme_recent2=⭐ 收藏了 银行自动取款机\ntoday_date=周日 · 赎罪日\nfriend1_name=精打细算张阿姨\nfriend1_action=点评了\nfriend1_target=隔夜剩菜\nfriend1_time=12 分钟前\nfriend2_name=隔壁苏大少\nfriend2_action=标记了\nfriend2_target=家里浴室\nfriend2_time=半小时前\n\n# 今日区\nt1=贫民窟二少|10分钟前|手洗床单|￥0|泡沫漫过脚踝，冷水刺骨，但我心如磐石。|5|5.0|只要能省下一度电，我这双手废了又何妨？老婆，看我表现！|省钱达人,贤惠男妈妈|66|12\nt1_c1=隔壁苏大少|8分钟前|你是不是疯了？你家破产了？|无\nt1_c2=贫民窟二少|7分钟前|你不懂，这是爱，这是节省，这是男德。|隔壁苏大少\nt1_c3=精打细算张阿姨|6分钟前|小伙子真会过日子，阿姨看好你！|无\n\n# 热榜区\nh1=抠门天花板|2小时前|隔夜剩菜|￥0|一盘发绿的青菜，但在微波炉里焕发新生。|5|4.9|热一热还能吃，倒掉就是浪费！谁懂这种变废为宝的快乐？|黑暗料理,光盘行动,极致抠门|2103|98|287\nh1_c1=养生专家|1小时前|吃了会拉肚子吧？|无\nh1_c2=抠门天花板|55分钟前|肠胃早已百毒不侵！|养生专家\nh1_c3=贫民窟二少|30分钟前|同道中人啊兄弟！|无\n\n# 附近区\nn1=蹭网达人|0.2km|刚刚|免费试吃|￥0|超市里的试吃小纸杯，装满了我的尊严。|4|4.3|只要脸皮够厚，一天吃遍三个超市，晚饭又省了。|超市,白嫖,极限生存|12|4\nn1_c1=超市理货员|刚刚|原来每天来蹭吃的是你！|无\nn1_c2=蹭网达人|刚刚|嘘，看破不说破！|超市理货员\nn1_c3=贫民窟二少|刚刚|大佬带带我！|无\n\n# 我的区\nmp1=贫民窟二少|昨天|公司茶水间咖啡|￥0|用别人剩下的咖啡渣，兑上免费开水。|4|4.3|虽然味道淡如水，但这是打工人的白嫖智慧。|打工人,白嫖,提神|31|7\nmp1_c1=怨种同事|昨天|难怪今天咖啡机空了！|无\nmp1_c2=贫民窟二少|昨天|这叫资源最大化利用。|怨种同事\nmp1_c3=老板|昨天|明天来我办公室一趟。|无\nmp1_c4=贫民窟二少|昨天|（已装死）|老板\nfav1=家里浴室|家庭琐事 · 避难所|4.8|🛁\nfav2=老婆公司|神仙打卡点 · 遥望|4.9|🏢\nfav3=银行自动取款机|伤心地 · 余额查询|4.7|🏧\nfav4=公司茶水间|打工人 · 免费续杯|4.5|☕\nmap1=家里浴室|0.0km|搓衣板旁边|省水,黑暗\nmap2=老婆公司|5.8km|我魂牵梦绕的地方|神圣,禁地\nmap3=银行自动取款机|1.5km|看着余额流泪的地方|扎心,贫穷\nmap4=公司茶水间|1.2km|有着免费咖啡渣的风水宝地|白嫖,摸鱼\n[/状态栏]"
